              <div class="text-block-89">Caruso St John Architects blend modern design with historical context. This concept redesign introduces a bold visual style that mirrors the studio’s ethos, integrating brand and layout into a cohesive, authentic digital presence.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container-project-intro">
      <div text-split="" scrub-each-word-slower="" class="into-project-subheading">Redesigning a website to embody architectural vision and brand identity</div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="csj-2x-desktop">
    <div class="csj-desktop _3"></div>
    <div class="csj-desktop"></div>
    <div class="csj-desktop _2"></div>
  </section>
  <section data-w-id="3ecc76dd-eb95-4ca2-1312-9b57c1ecbe2b" class="csj-2x-mobile">
    <div class="csj-mobile _1">
